OL,3,GNEWSASchool holiday travel prices lead
OL,4,Ato pupil absence
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents have said the high cost of
OL,7,Ftravelling away from Jersey during the
OL,8,Fschool holidays has led them to take
OL,9,Ftheir children out of school for a
OL,10,Ftrip.
OL,12,FMother-of-two Annie Noble said the
OL,13,Fprice of flights and hotels for her
OL,14,Ffamily to visit Belfast had more than
OL,15,Fdoubled during the school holidays,
OL,16,Fcompared to term time.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
