OL,3,GNEWSASchool holiday travel prices lead
OL,4,Ato pupil absence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA record number of fines were issued in
OL,7,FEngland last year for children being
OL,8,Ftaken out of school for holidays and
OL,9,Fsome parents have said they accept the
OL,10,Ffines because they can save so much
OL,11,Fmoney.
OL,13,FThe education departments in Jersey and
OL,14,FGuernsey do not issue fines but they
OL,15,Fhave told parents they should "avoid
OL,16,Fbooking holidays in term time whenever
OL,17,Fpossible".
